WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.834
Yaa a Yennenga, rĩm-poak ning sẽn kẽed ne soaalã. Yaa moos-rãmbã lagem-n-taar.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.784
A Nedega naam da yaa Gambaga, Dagomba soolmẽ.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.954
A ra maanda sũ-noog ne a bi-puglã. A sũur yɩɩ noog ne-a n yɩɩd a sodaasã fãa.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.898
Yaa a Yennenga n lʋɩt so-pakdbã taoor. Ned baa a yen ka zẽkd wa yẽ ye, la ned ba a yen pa zɩt wa yẽnda ye.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.656
B bɛɛbã yãe-a lame n zoe.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.264
Wakat ning fãa, a ra lebda a ba wã taoore n tõoge.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:12.084
Ba, mam dat n kẽe kãadem la m dog kamb.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:17.270
Fo tara yõod wʋsg zab-teedã pʋgẽ. Yaa sɩd tɩ pa woto ye.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:24.138
A yeela woto naoor wʋsgo. A ra pa tol n bas-a ye.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:45.536
Rẽ n so t'a pagã bʋd a Okra pʋʋgẽ, roogã sɛɛgẽ.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:02:02.710
Kẽerã bɩame, la b kʋɩɩme. A pa wʋk-a ye. Gomdã ra yaa vẽenega: ned pa segd n bas tɩ bũmb nins sẽn bɩ wã sãam ye.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.560
La rĩmã ra pa rat n wʋm a võore.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:20.072
Daar a ye yʋngo, a Yennenga kẽnga a wed-bil sẽn yaa pemse, n yi Gambaga.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:29.240
A ra gũuda kiuugã pʋgẽ n pa wẽnemd a meng ye.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:54.024
A sẽn yã bũmb ningã kɩtame t'a kẽng zĩig sẽn zãre, zĩig a sẽn da pa mi.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:01.610
A sẽn wa n beẽ wã, a ra yɛɛsame. Ned n kolgame, t'a tãag-a lame.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.900
Yãmb yaa ãnna? Fo maanda bõe be?

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.900
Mam yʋʋr la a Yennenga. Mam basa bũmb fãa.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.632
Dɩɩ-y n zĩnd be, la y na n paama laafɩ.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:32.426
A ra yaa Rialé, zĩ-yũud a ye. B ra nong taaba, tɩ b dog bi-ribl.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.840
A yʋʋr na n yɩɩ Ouédraogo.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:50.554
A Zezi yeel-b lame yaa: "Bɩ y bãng tɩ m na n dɩka bi-riblã, la b kõ-y sũ-noogo".

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:08.530
Yʋʋmã loogame. A Yennenga wa n lebg n waa Gambaga ne a bi-riblã.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:21.146
La rĩm-gãsenga bãngame t'a pagã yaa a soaba. A Zeova kõ-a-la sugri, n deeg a bi-puglã.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:28.472
A kõo a Ouédraogo so-rãmb la sodaasã.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:35.152
Rẽ n so t'a Ouedraogo, a Mozi rãmbã yaab-rãmbã kibar sɩngre.
